# Crafting & Itemization Rules

## High-End Meta
- **Recombinators**: Focus on high-iLevel base preservation and optimal modifier weights.
- **Base Tiers**: Only discuss T1/T2 bases and high-end unique interactions.
- **Omens**: Include Omen usage for crafting (e.g., Omen of Chaotic Quality for Waystones).

## Style
- **Cost Analysis**: Include estimated crafting costs in Exalted Orbs.
- **Success Rates**: Provide estimated probabilities for high-risk recombinations or crafts.
